# Discord #bug-reports 11-06: the Paint menu jittered in a 1280x720 fullscreen window. It is taller than the space under
# the menu bar, so it scrolls; its colour picker and swatches fit the menu's width, so the scrollbar narrowed them, the
# menu got short enough not to scroll, the scrollbar went, and so on every frame. CMake runs it at 1280x720
# (ui_menu_stable_720) too. Every task menu holds still once open.
run new_sphere subdivisions=3
ui_scale 100
wait_idle 30
click "Paint##menu.paint"
wait 0.3
print menu_rect_changes
wait 0.5
expect_value menu_rect_changes == 0
shot paint-menu
key escape
click "Sculpt##menu.sculpt"
wait 0.3
print menu_rect_changes
wait 0.5
expect_value menu_rect_changes == 0
key escape
click "Render##menu.render"
wait 0.3
print menu_rect_changes
wait 0.5
expect_value menu_rect_changes == 0
key escape
ui_scale 150
wait_idle 30
click "Paint##menu.paint"
wait 0.3
print menu_rect_changes
wait 0.5
expect_value menu_rect_changes == 0
key escape
